================================================================================
<===> error/argument/type/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@include meta.css(1);

<===> error/argument/type/error
Error: $module: 1 is neither a string nor a module reference.
  ,
2 | @include meta.css(1);
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:1  root stylesheet

