================================================================================
<===> error/argument/too_few/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@include meta.css();

<===> error/argument/too_few/error
Error: Missing argument $module.
  ,--> input.scss
2 | @include meta.css();
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ invocation
  '
  ,--> sass:meta
1 | @mixin css($module) {
  |        ============ declaration
  '
  input.scss 2:1  root stylesheet

